  "id": "rsvp",
  "term": "RSVP",
  "definition": "RSVP stands for rapid serial visual presentation, a task in which visual items are shown in quick succession. In psychology and cognition research, it is used to study attention because people must stay engaged while processing a fast-paced stream of visual information.",
